  "body": "<h1>Fishing Competition 2022</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nTIDE continued to celebrate its 25th Anniversary with the Fishing Tournament on Oct 16, 2022. We thank all the participants of the tournament for going out and making their catch. Boats left TIDE dock in the early morning and returned by 1pm. Winners of the tournament include:\n<strong>1st Place</strong> – Largest fish won by the boat – Jay Sparrow, with a whopping weight of 30.9 pounds: Congrats to Jack Alford, Jason Guy, Rodney Selgado, John Romero\n<strong>2nd Place</strong> – 3 Largest fish won by the boat – Jay Sparrow, with a cumulative weight of 34.80 pounds: Congrats to Jack Alford, Jason Guy, Rodney Selgado, John Romero\n<strong>3rd Place</strong> – Largest Jack won by the boat – Taly Tacuma, with a weight of 5.15 pounds: Congrats to Gerson Coleman, Leslie Coleman, Julia Coleman &amp; Anthony Coleman.\n\n\nAgain we say congrats to all the participants of the tournament and see you next year!\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div id=\"gallery-4\"><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/01-1st-Place.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/01-1st-Place.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/02-2nd-place.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/02-2nd-place.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/03-3rd-place-2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/03-3rd-place-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/03-3rd-place-3-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/03-3rd-place-3-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_184426570-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_184426570-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_184613071.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_184613071.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185141824.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185141824.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185425350.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185425350.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185440115.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185440115.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185701396.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185701396.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185803468-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185803468-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185845219.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_185845219.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_190058054.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_190058054.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_191556997.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PXL_20221016_191556997.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-10-16-at-3.48.21-PM.jpeg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-10-16-at-3.48.21-PM.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure>\n</div>"
